This is not. Low level protection running is difficult even as a gnome,
and as a (chaotic) elf, you're just asking for lots of deaths. This is
more than likely the reason for all of your gnome/dwarf deaths. I
usually head for sokoban before the mines as a wizard, since the mines
are fairly difficult.

