You can get killed by holy water by quaffing it as a chaotic character.
Giant mimics do hit pretty hard, so avoiding them if at all possible is
a good thing to do.

> Mimics are a real problem when I'll try not to level up, but I still
> need to go to stores to get money for protection. I'll usually try
> maneuvering around them if my pet doesn't kill them, which is usually
> the case. Doesn't my pet see mimic?

This is a good strategy for mimics, which can be helped by
understanding the way they move. They should get a turn every fourth
turn of yours (assuming you don't have speed),  and they either attack
or move on that turn. If you make sure you aren't next to them when
they get their turn, you should be fine.

